# This repo: `repo.wawona.io`

One host, **two channels**. Mixing indexes or auto-discovery across channels is
a compliance bug.

```text
/search/                 → humans: choose wasm or debs. Never a mixed list.
/search/?channel=wasm    → humans: App Store / Play wasm only (store compliance)
/search/?channel=deb     → humans: APT debs. Two audiences, never call Termux jailbreak.
/wasm/v1/                → Mode A: WASI packages for Wawona Runtime (store-safe CDN data)
/                        → APT (Packages + debs). Sileo and Termux both use this URL.
/jailbreak/              → iOS Sileo bookmark (rootless + rootful). Not Termux.
/termux/                 → Android Termux sideload bookmark. Not jailbreak. Not Play.
```

`/wasm/`, `/deb/`, `/jailbreak/`, and `/termux/` HTML redirect into `/search/`.
Never redirect `/wasm/v1/` or `/Packages`. The website may link both catalogs.
It must not show them as one results list. Store `wpm` must never see debs.

Deb APT audiences (same `Packages` file, split by Architecture):

| Audience | Client | Architecture | Jailbreak? |
|----------|--------|--------------|------------|
| Jailbroken iOS | Sileo / Zebra | `iphoneos-arm64` rootless, `iphoneos-arm` rootful, optional `iphoneos-arm64e` RootHide | Yes |
| Sideloaded Android | Termux `apt` | `aarch64` (and `arm`) | **No** |

## Hard firewall

| Consumer | `/wasm/v1` | APT `/` (`Packages`) |
|---|---|---|
| App Store / Play / `wpm` in store builds | Yes | **Never** |
| Sileo on jailbroken iOS | Optional | Yes |
| Termux on sideloaded Android | Optional | Yes |
| Website Mode B / sideload pages | Optional | Yes |

`/jailbreak/` is an iOS Sileo bookmark onto `/search/?channel=deb`. It is **not**
the APT tree and **not** Termux. Store `wpm` must never fetch it.

## Also publish (Mode B)

- Auto-package **Wawona iOS Mode B IPA** for Sileo (distinct from App Store IPA).
- Desktop / LockScreen / Swinging Bridge Mode B **tweaks** as `.deb`, not as
  Wasm packages.

## Never

- One index listing both `.wasm` and `.deb`
- Teach store `wpm` to probe `/jailbreak/`, `/termux/`, `/Packages`, or `.deb`
- Call Termux debs jailbreak. Termux is sideloaded Android only. Not Play.
- Claim Wawona Runtime needs Mode B to install packages (Runtime is Mode A only)
- Lump Sileo and Termux as one jailbreak product

See `wawona-product-map` and `Wawona/docs/wasm-package-manager.md`.
